# Tableverse: this file has no variables on purpose.
#
# Local development: copy .env.local.example to .env.local (git-ignored). See docs/LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT.md.
# Production: values are set in the Render dashboard and in GitHub settings, never in a file. The names, purposes and
# locations of every variable are listed in docs/TECHNICAL_ARCHITECTURE.md, section C, and in render.yaml.
#
# Never copy production values into any file in this repository.
